 "summary": "The command language of the Redis key-value data-structure server: flat, verb-first commands (GET, SET, LPUSH, ZRANGE, XADD ...) over strings, lists, hashes, sets, sorted sets and streams, sent over the RESP wire protocol, with MULTI/EXEC transactions, pub/sub, and server-side Lua scripts and functions.",
