 "level_notes": {
  "1": "The command reference (one page per command, generated from the JSON command specs in the source tree) and the RESP protocol specification are the definition. Valkey (the 2024 BSD-licensed fork) documents the same command set.",
  "0": "redis/redis (C) is the reference implementation; each command's syntax is declared in src/commands/*.json and compiled into commands.def. Valkey is a compatible fork."
 },
